OL,3,AUS hits three Iranian oil tankers after
OL,4,Asaying its warships were targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US military says it has hit three
OL,7,FIran-linked oil tankers after Iran
OL,8,Flaunched ballistic missiles towards two
OL,9,FAmerican Navy warships in the region.
OL,11,FUS Central Command (Centcom) said on
OL,12,FSaturday it had "permanently disabled"
OL,13,Fa tanker near Kharg Island and another
OL,14,Fnear Jask in the Gulf of Oman, and
OL,15,F"completely destroyed" a third in the
OL,16,FGulf of Oman.
OL,18,F"It's simple: if Iran shoots at US
OL,19,Fships, we will destroy (and sink) their
OL,20,Foil tankers," Defence Secretary Pete
OL,21,FHegseth wrote on social media.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
