OL,3,AUS hits three Iranian oil tankers after
OL,4,Asaying its warships were targeted
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran's state media confirmed the
OL,7,Fattacks. A spokesperson for Iran's
OL,8,Fmilitary warned that strikes on US
OL,9,Fmilitary vessels would be expanded if
OL,10,Fthey continued attacking Iranian ships,
OL,11,Fthe state media reported.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
